\begin{rSubsection}{Tsinghua University -- Natural Language Processing Lab (THUNLP)}{Mar 2026 -- Present}{Research Intern, AI for Science \quad | \quad Advisor: Zheni Zeng}{}
\item Built a scientific discovery agent that combines molecular observations, surrogate predictions, and executable analysis to propose hypotheses and select follow-up tests on unseen scaffolds.
