\item Designed controlled evaluations that isolate the effects of retrieval, search budget, and prover choice on proof success.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{NJU Institute of Intelligent Networks and Communications (NINE)}{Aug 2026 -- Present}{Research Intern \quad | \quad Supervisor: Huihong Liang; Institute Director: Kun Yang}{}
\item Implemented selective token refresh and temporal feature reuse in a Raspberry Pi 5 encoder, achieving \textbf{18.3 FPS} in a sender-side benchmark.
\item Built a reconstruction evaluation pipeline that measures fidelity around moving people using reference regions from the original footage.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{Wuxi Xishan NJU Institute of Applied Biotechnology}{Sep 2026 -- Present}{Research Intern, Computational Enzyme Discovery}{}
\item Translated biochemical reaction queries into experimental screening shortlists by combining model rankings with supporting evidence.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{Beijing Volcano Engine Technology Co., Ltd.}{Aug 2026 -- Present}{Agent Development Engineer \quad | \quad Client: Guizhou Xijiu Group}{}
\item Built Xijiu's document workflow for source-linked drafting, semantic review, and iterative revision.
\item Integrated enterprise retrieval, model routing, and document editing through reusable adapters, with source checks and task state carried across review rounds.
