\item Developed backend services and APIs and integrated model inference into client-facing applications.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{Evidence-Grounded Enzyme--Reaction Discovery (iGEM 2026)}{2026}{NJU-China \quad | \quad Student Leader (Head of the Dry Lab) \quad | \quad \cvsmalllink{https://www.runnelzhang.com/posters/igem-atlas}{Poster}}{}
\item Led development of BRIDGE, a bidirectional enzyme--reaction retrieval model that combines learned representations with gated expert signals. It achieved \textbf{2.7$\times$ to 3.5$\times$} EnzymeCAGE's balanced top-10 recall across the two directions.
\item Integrated BRIDGE with COMPASS and EDGE to support natural-language searches and inspection of the evidence behind ranked candidates.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{BiSem-Edge: Compute-Efficient Semantic Video}{2026}{NINE Lab \quad | \quad \cvsmalllink{https://www.runnelzhang.com/posters/bisem-edge}{Poster}}{}
