\item Used compact PCA side information to restore image detail lost in the original decoder, improving reconstruction PSNR by 1.18 dB on held-out cameras.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{TRACE: Typed Reasoning with Attribution, Certificates, and Evidence}{2026}{Formal reasoning research linked to MSRA work \quad | \quad \cvsmalllink{https://www.runnelzhang.com/posters/trace}{Poster}}{}
